<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In a competitive market such as the restaurant industry, comprehending the subtleties of the factors Influencing Business Success for stakeholders, grasping the factors that impact business success is crucial. This project seeks to examine the connection between user engagement like reviews, tips, and check-ins and business success metrics, such as review count and ratings, specifically focusing on restaurants, using the Yelp dataset.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
