/S /H1
/T (High ratings don't always result in more reviews, and more reviews don't necessarily mean better ratings. A restaurant's success isn't just about its ratings or the number of reviews it receives.  Although a high review count shows user engagement, it doesn't always reflect customer satisfaction or business success.)
